OL,3,GNEWSAStates plans to penalise inactive
OL,4,Adevelopers
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs young people in Guernsey struggle
OL,7,Ftaking their first steps onto the
OL,8,Fproperty ladder, the Committee for
OL,9,FHousing is looking to penalise
OL,10,Fdevelopers that sit on land without
OL,11,Fbuilding homes in an effort to
OL,12,Fencourage building and reduce prices.
OL,14,FBuilder Sheridan Bourgaize said he had
OL,15,Falways planned to buy a home in
OL,16,FGuernsey, but with prices and the cost
OL,17,Fof living increasing he had changed his
OL,18,Fmind.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
