OL,3,GNEWSAStates plans to penalise inactive
OL,4,Adevelopers
OL,5,
OL,6,F"A lot of the younger generation is
OL,7,Fabout to move off island in all
OL,8,Fhonesty," he said and blamed the high
OL,9,Fcost of property.
OL,11,FProperty prices have gone up by more
OL,12,Fthan 52% in the last decade, with the
OL,13,Faverage house costing #608,844, while
OL,14,Frents have risen by 65% to on average
OL,15,F#2,138 per month.
